{"answer": 3, "html": "\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">1</span> 곱의 미분법을 쓴다</div>\n    $$\n    f'(x)=\\left(2x^2-x-2\\right)+(x+2)(4x-1).\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-step\">\n    <div class=\"sol-h\"><span class=\"sol-num\">2</span> \\(x=1\\)을 대입한다</div>\n    $$\n    f'(1)=(2-1-2)+3\\times3=-1+9=8.\n    $$\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"sol-final\">답 &nbsp;③</div>\n"}